{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36410","headline":"冬夕江上言事五首 三 · 罗邺","name":"冬夕江上言事五首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"野堂吟罢独行行，点水微微冻不鸣。\n十里溪山新雪後，千家襟袖晓寒生。\n只宜醉梦依华寝，可称羸蹄赴宿程。\n日苦几多心下见，那堪岁晏又无成。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗邺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36410.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36410","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}